Defy the odds.

2
00:11:13,043 --> 00:11:19,043
Young Woman and the Sea is a history, drama film directed by Joachim Rønning.

3
00:16:49,565 --> 00:16:55,565
This is the extraordinary true story of Trudy Ederle, the first
woman to successfully swim the English Channel.

4
00:22:26,086 --> 00:22:32,086
Through the steadfast support of her older sister and supportive trainers, she overcame adversity and the animosity of a patriarchal
society to rise through the ranks of the Olympic swimming team and complete the 21-mile trek from France to England.

5
