Trudy Ederle, played by Daisy Ridley.

6
00:33:39,130 --> 00:33:45,130
Meg Ederle, played by Tilda Cobham-Hervey.

7
00:39:15,652 --> 00:39:21,652
Bill Burgess, played by Stephen Graham.

8
